    enum_variant_payload_types_discarded_at_parse_2026-07-29, 1, "2026-11-02 release reconciliation: parser/decl/bridge capture payload types, counts, and names; semantic_api/checker.spl:229 remains case Enum(_): pass, so keep OPEN. PR #5945 merged c00113a0dc484c7654552762d38869b1d8da891c corrected the spec contract. Eight direct fixtures passed under unadmitted seed FC56D4B5...B081828; exact source-root caveat and hashes are in evidence/enum_payload_capture_phase1_2026-11-02.sdn. Standard test runner stopped before cases with unavailable SDN worker; no Phase 2 qualification."
    enum_variant_payload_types_discarded_at_parse_2026-07-29, 0, "2026-11-27 p3sweep-20261127: implemented the remaining acceptance scope in src/compiler/35.semantics/lint/semantic_api/checker.spl - new check_enum_payload_texts walks the flat variant_payload_type_names list sliced by variant_payload_counts and routes each captured payload type through check_type_text with MC-API-002 semantics, mirroring struct/class field checks; unit variants and legacy EnumDefs without payload lists stay silent; case Enum(_): pass replaced with the wired arm. Spec test/01_unit/compiler/lint/semantic_api_checker_spec.spl extended to unit/tuple/struct + nested Option<i32> payload cases: 19/19 PASS on a fresh HEAD-built seed (build-commit 7ec0a1ed579); co-compile with semantic_api_exported_graph, package_manifest and tag_walk PASS. close_evidence reproducer=test/01_unit/compiler/lint/semantic_api_checker_spec.spl prevention=test/01_unit/compiler/lint/semantic_api_exported_graph_spec.spl"

